      "taskMessage": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Service identification now has both halves of the finding: the observed service and RailGate's placement rule. Identify the maintenance-only console port so the remediation ticket remains precise.",
      "taskInstructions": "Read the console port from the RailGate note, or run <b>nmap -sV 10.42.18.73</b> to see which port serves <b>RailGate Diagnostics 3.4.7</b>.",
